Vapour Profiler licensing

Userspace Rust code, test fixtures, scripts, and documentation are licensed,
at your option, under either MIT (LICENSE-MIT) or Apache-2.0 (LICENSE-APACHE).

BPF C programs in crates/vp-bpf/bpf/ are licensed under GPL-2.0-only
(LICENSE-GPL-2.0). Their kernel license declaration is "GPL" to enable
GPL-only BPF helpers. Embedding those programs does not relicense them.

Third-party dependencies retain their own licenses.
